{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soul Rift </strong>- is a unique mix of <strong>RPG and RTS</strong> in a magical world where you will take on the role of a wizard serving the gods. Your decisions will determine the fate of this world and its inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a wizard</strong> - learn powerful spells and use them in tactical battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build an army</strong> - summon a variety of creatures that fight independently enough and don't require constant attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and strengthen</strong> - build magical structures that improve your abilities and give you strategic advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight for power</strong> - take part in challenges against other mages to gain new spells and replenish your army with new creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take on the challenge of the gods and prove yourself worthy of their power?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3584630?t=1773837527","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584630/10dfea84e0644b22d9a5e64196679d5d76839233/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773837527","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584630/3b85852bd6ec73b8c23bb264d698be473d459120/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773837527","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584630/3b85852bd6ec73b8c23bb264d698be473d459120/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773837527","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soul Rift </strong>- is a unique mix of <strong>RPG and RTS</strong> in a magical world where you will take on the role of a wizard serving the gods. Your decisions will determine the fate of this world and its inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a wizard</strong> - learn powerful spells and use them in tactical battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build an army</strong> - summon a variety of creatures that fight independently enough and don't require constant attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and strengthen</strong> - build magical structures that improve your abilities and give you strategic advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight for power</strong> - take part in challenges against other mages to gain new spells and replenish your army with new creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take on the challenge of the gods and prove yourself worthy of their power?</p>","developers":["Mysak Danylo"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584630/e7ef80cb1ae1b9d8840a513a1a394e64b92cf3d4/header.jpg?t=1773837527","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3584630/858434/d2dfab9741d3ba11836e37501039d05981ebf2bd/1750461439/dash_av1.mpd?t=1743464263","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3584630/858434/d2dfab9741d3ba11836e37501039d05981ebf2bd/1750461439/dash_h264.mpd?t=1743464263","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/358463